{"nodes": [{"id": "supabase_tests_config_writers_test_config_writers_test", "label": "config_writers_test (card ^ref-11)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "supabase/tests/config_writers_test.sql", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Failure-case suite for the four config setters (fn_set_config, fn_set_product_price, fn_set_smoke_fee_tier, fn_set_packaging_full_stock), TC-11 ... TC-28 and TC-31 of TDD-config-layer.md. Asserts: an L2 or deactivated Owner cannot write a rate (ADR-004, R31); created_by is not a parameter, so a rate change cannot be signed as somebody else; a setter inserts rather than updates, so last month's closed P&L cannot move (BR23); a retry from a dropped connection neither double-writes nor raises into a retry loop (R4); a same-day correction leaves a trace; a band set with a gap, an overlap or no open top band is refused (D02, BR10); a second GLOBAL full-stock row for one date is refused; a zero full-stock level is refused because it becomes a divisor (R9); and the card grants no session SELECT on a price table (ADR-004, R20)."}], "edges": [{"source": "supabase_tests_config_writers_test_config_writers_test", "target": "supabase_functions_fn_set_config_fn_set_config", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "supabase/tests/config_writers_test.sql", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "supabase_tests_config_writers_test_config_writers_test", "target": "supabase_functions_fn_set_product_price_fn_set_product_price", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "supabase/tests/config_writers_test.sql", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "supabase_tests_config_writers_test_config_writers_test", "target": "supabase_functions_fn_set_smoke_fee_tier_fn_set_smoke_fee_tier", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "sou